    'Treatment is not cosmetic—it moves the failure curve. Boron-based systems target starch-loving pests; pressure helps chemistry reach the inner wall.'
    || E'\n\nPair treatment with a drying target suited to your end use: furniture wants stability, outdoor structures want a buffer against rain cycles.'
    || E'\n\nAsk your supplier for batch records so you can align warranty and maintenance plans with what actually entered the cylinder.',
